kicker: Device 1 in action
big: Exodus 3:14
tile: [[John 4:26]] | I that speak unto thee am *he*
tile: [[John 8:24]] | Ye shall die in your sins
tile: [[John 8:28]] | When ye have lifted up the Son of man
tile: [[John 8:58]] | Before Abraham was, I am
tile: [[John 13:19]] | That ye may believe that I am *he*
tile: [[John 18:5-6]] | I am *he*

